<p>Share your hatred with all shadows within sight range, gaining temporary full control. You then fire a blast of pure hatred from all affected shadows, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">108, 146, 175, 200, 222</acronym> Mind damage per blast.</p><p>You cannot cancel this talent once the first bolt is cast.</p><p>Damage increases with your Mindpower.</p>